sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Service as UserRelationshipService
    participant Graph as RelationshipGraph
    participant Cache as CacheService
    participant EventBus as Event Bus
    participant Store as RelationshipStore

    Note over Client,Store: Follow User Flow

    Client->>Service: follow(userId, targetUserId)

    Service->>Service: validateUserIds()
    Service->>Service: checkRateLimit()

    Service->>Store: findRelationship()
    alt Already Following
        Store-->>Service: Existing Relationship
        Service-->>Client: Return Existing (Idempotent)
    else Not Following
        Service->>Service: validateRelationship()
        Service->>Service: checkPrivacySettings()

        Service->>Store: create Relationship
        Store-->>Service: New Relationship

        Service->>Graph: addFollow()
        Graph-->>Service: Updated Graph

        Service->>Cache: invalidate(patterns)
        Cache-->>Service: Cache Cleared

        Service->>EventBus: emit('user.followed')
        EventBus-->>Service: Event Published

        Service-->>Client: Return Relationship
    end

    Note over Client,Store: Block User Flow (with Cascade)

    Client->>Service: block(userId, targetUserId)

    Service->>Service: validateUserIds()
    Service->>Service: checkRateLimit()

    Service->>Service: unfollow(both directions)
    Service->>Store: create Block Relationship
    Service->>Graph: addBlock()
    Service->>Cache: invalidate(patterns)
    Service->>EventBus: emit('user.blocked')

    Service-->>Client: Return Block Relationship
